    <briefdescription>
<para>Manage lifetime of a slot tracker for printing IR. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wrapper around the <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_slot_tracker" kindref="compound">SlotTracker</ref></emphasis> used internally by <emphasis>AsmWriter</emphasis>. This class allows callers to share the cost of incorporating the metadata in a module or a function.</para>
<para>If the IR changes from underneath <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module_slot_tracker" kindref="compound">ModuleSlotTracker</ref></emphasis>, strings like &quot;&lt;badref&gt;&quot; will be printed, or, worse, the wrong slots entirely. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
